	"system": {
		"description": "<p>While many artifacts are handed down, or bear a sapience within, rare is the artifact not created for a purpose. And for the knight banneret, that purpose is leadership on the field of battle. Whether guiding warcasters or knights, it is your duty and responsibility to take command with your mystical and martial capabilities blended into a harmonious whole.</p><p><strong>Table: Knight Banneret</strong></p><table style=\"width: 100.008%;\" border=\"1\"><colgroup><col style=\"width: 16.0457%;\"><col style=\"width: 84.0636%;\"></colgroup><thead><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>Level</td><td>Features</td></tr></thead><tbody><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>1st</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.hdU9wi0tNUl2gf0e]{Knight Banneret Spellcasting} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.VGh8RxbdURyZO16c]{Aura of Command} @UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.NEmEzfsRCWQTF3wZ]{Knight of the Banner}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>6th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.5BRWOxBZC6rEIFLG]{Inspiring Command}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>10th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.572gqdtH9Y796Y6k]{Defensive Warding}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>14th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.GwYV9Z36c1WrBdkQ]{Martial Aura}</td></tr><tr style=\"text-align: center;\"><td>18th</td><td>@UUID[Compendium.a5e.a5e-class-features.Item.T7vNrzLMbKTdlImJ]{Seize the Field}</td></tr></tbody></table>",
